y Features","items":[{"h":"Part No (P/N): OT-S1GCT","c":[]},{"h":"Max. Data Rate: 1000Mbps","c":[]},{"h":"Max. Cable Distance: 100m","c":[]},{"h":"Interface: RJ45 (10/100/1000M Copper)","c":[]},{"h":"Transmission Media : CAT5E / CAT6 Cable","c":[]},{"h":"Easy Installation: Plug &amp; Play Compatibility","c":[]},{"h":"All Brands Routers &amp; Switches SFP Compatibility","c":[]},{"h":"1-Year (Replacement Warranty)","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"184\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"184\">OTECH 1GE SFP Module 10/100/1000BASE-T Copper RJ45 100M</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"647\" class=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"226\">OTECH 1GE SFP Copper RJ45 Module</strong> delivers high-speed Gigabit Ethernet connectivity over standard <strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"317\">Cat5e/6 copper cabling</strong>. Supporting <strong data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"366\">10/100/1000Mbps auto-negotiation</strong>, this hot-pluggable SFP module offers a convenient and cost-effective solution for short-distance network connections up to <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"505\">100 meters</strong>. It has a <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"556\">standard RJ45 interface</strong>, making it ideal for switches, routers, and network interface cards (NICs) with SFP ports.</p>\n<p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"666\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"666\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"933\"><li data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"714\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"714\" class=\"\">Data Rate: 10/100/1000Mbps (Auto-Negotiation)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"739\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"739\" class=\"\">Interface: RJ45 Copper</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"781\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"781\" class=\"\">Distance: Up to 100 meters over Cat5e/6</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"820\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"820\" class=\"\">Compatible with IEEE 802.3 standards</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"852\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"852\" class=\"\">Hot-pluggable SFP form factor</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"878\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"878\" class=\"\">Plug-and-play operation</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"933\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"933\" class=\"\">Ideal for LAN, campus networks, and SMB environments</p>\n</li></ul>\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1095\" class=\"\">Get reliable and flexible copper connectivity with the <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1019\">OTECH 1GE SFP RJ45 Module</strong>, designed for stable Gigabit performance without needing fiber optics.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QSFP+ LC BiDi 150m MMF SFP Module","href":"/hpe-aruba-40g-qsfp-lc-bidi-150m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"7,000৳","old":"8,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco 40GBASE QSFP-40G-LR4-S 1310nm Sing